OL,8,G1700 Witness History
OL,9,     FIn the summer of 1937 some of the
OL,10,     F20th century's most famous
OL,11,     Fartists, writers and photographers
OL,12,     Fwere holidaying in the south of
OL,13,     FFrance. They included Pablo
OL,14,     FPicasso and Lee Miller.
